WEBVTT

00:09:27.763 --> 00:09:31.376
and beyond evaluating risk
in our environment,

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.835
what this body of research tells us

00:09:33.859 --> 00:09:38.664
is that in the world of communicating
for the purposes of influence,

00:09:38.688 --> 00:09:41.680
quality trumps quantity.

00:09:42.799 --> 00:09:45.554
By increasing the number of arguments,

00:09:45.578 --> 00:09:47.498
you do not strengthen your case,

00:09:47.522 --> 00:09:49.985
but rather you actively weaken it.

00:09:51.322 --> 00:09:52.473
Put another way,

00:09:52.497 --> 00:09:55.394
you cannot increase
the quality of an argument

00:09:55.418 --> 00:09:58.748
by simply increasing
the quantity of your argument.